 How are big companies governing AI? 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 As Washington weighs how to oversee AI, a new EY survey of senior AI executives at publicly traded, billion-dollar companies finds 98% have formal governance policies in place, while 47% say they have bypassed them for urgent deployments.


