A MESSAGE FROM EY

 
 98% have AI governance rules. 47% admit to bypassing them 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 So how are big companies managing the risk? A new EY survey finds 91% are running agentic AI, sometimes without human in the loop, and more than a third report an AI incident with material impact, a real concern as Washington weighs AI oversight.


